{"id":4328,"name":"Isekai Suicide Squad","slug":"isekai_suicide_squad","synopsis":"In the crime-ridden city of Gotham, Amanda Waller, the head of A.R.G.U.S., has assembled a group of notorious criminals for a mission: Harley Quinn, Deadshot, Peacemaker, Clayface, and King Shark. These Super-Villains are sent into an otherworldly realm that’s connected to this world through a gate. It’s a world of swords and magic where orcs rampage and dragons rule the skies—an “ISEKAI”!\n\nWith lethal explosives planted in their necks, there’s no running or hiding, and failing the mission means a one-way ticket to the afterlife! Can Harley Quinn and her crew conquer this perilous ISEKAI realm?! Brace yourselves for the pulse-pounding saga of the elite task force known as the “Suicide Squad” as they embark on a jaw-dropping adventure!","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2024,"createdAt":"2024-06-28 20:00:03","updatedAt":"2024-06-28 20:00:03","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":55848},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":47687},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":166710},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18098},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":23650},{"site":"ANN","externalId":28894}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":11886,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/38rYwnNuc5mWyZFVFM9hHicSKcVVbE7JBCMp8lhP.jpg"},{"id":11887,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/jEda3IwSBLhWRJGo8UZrrUb3v9fWETVIsckmqTJv.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":202,"name":"Wit Studio","slug":"wit_studio"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":12968,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12917,"title":"Another World","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":15169,"version":1,"episodes":"2-5, 7-8","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":17890,"basename":"IsekaiSuicideSquad-OP1.webm","filename":"IsekaiSuicideSquad-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Ise